#### Always clean up View Transition Events

View Transition Events should always return a cleanup function:

```js {7}
<ViewTransition
  onEnter={(instance) => {
    const anim = instance.new.animate(
      SLIDE_IN,
      {duration: 500, easing: 'ease-out'}
    );
    return () => anim.cancel();
  }}
>

